{"id":"fd1bbc49a4004fb5","group":"58","path":"58/batch19/58-df-zfc-poset-dcpo.md","title":"ZFC Poset Dcpo","display":"df-zfc-poset-dcpo — ZFC Poset Dcpo","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-poset-dcpo","aliases":["58-df-zfc-poset-dcpo"],"display":"df-zfc-poset-dcpo — ZFC Poset Dcpo","depends_on":["[[58-df-zfc-partial-order]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-poset-dcpo"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-poset-dcpo</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-poset-dcpo — ZFC Poset Dcpo"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"9ee45afab4c00dd5\" href=\"?note=9ee45afab4c00dd5\" title=\"58-df-zfc-partial-order\">58-df-zfc-partial-order</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P,\\leq_P\\in V\">\\(P,\\leq_P\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PartialOrder}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{PartialOrder}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"9ee45afab4c00dd5\" href=\"?note=9ee45afab4c00dd5\" title=\"58-df-zfc-partial-order\">58-df-zfc-partial-order</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcPosetDcpo}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcPosetDcpo}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span></li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}poset\\text{-}dcpo} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcPosetDcpo}_S(P,\\leq_P)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{PartialOrder}_S(P,\\leq_P)\\land\\forall D\\subseteq P\\;\\Bigl((D\\neq\\varnothing\\land\\forall x,y\\in D\\;\\exists z\\in D\\;(\\langle x,z\\rangle\\in\\leq_P\\land\\langle y,z\\rangle\\in\\leq_P))\\to\\exists s\\in P\\;(\\forall d\\in D\\;(\\langle d,s\\rangle\\in\\leq_P)\\land\\forall u\\in P\\;((\\forall d\\in D\\;(\\langle d,u\\rangle\\in\\leq_P))\\to\\langle s,u\\rangle\\in\\leq_P))\\Bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}poset\\text{-}dcpo} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcPosetDcpo}_S(P,\\leq_P)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{PartialOrder}_S(P,\\leq_P)\\land\\forall D\\subseteq P\\;\\Bigl((D\\neq\\varnothing\\land\\forall x,y\\in D\\;\\exists z\\in D\\;(\\langle x,z\\rangle\\in\\leq_P\\land\\langle y,z\\rangle\\in\\leq_P))\\to\\exists s\\in P\\;(\\forall d\\in D\\;(\\langle d,s\\rangle\\in\\leq_P)\\land\\forall u\\in P\\;((\\forall d\\in D\\;(\\langle d,u\\rangle\\in\\leq_P))\\to\\langle s,u\\rangle\\in\\leq_P))\\Bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Directed sets are nonempty, and their supremum is specified by its least-upper-bound universal property.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-df-zfc-partial-order","status":"resolved","id":"9ee45afab4c00dd5","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-zfc-partial-order]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-zfc-partial-order","status":"resolved","id":"9ee45afab4c00dd5","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{PartialOrder}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}$ (see [[58-df-zfc-partial-order]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"P,\\leq_P\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{PartialOrder}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcPosetDcpo}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\